    "initialText": "Little Plot Collective\n\nLIM CHU KANG, SINGAPORE · SYNTHETIC SIMULATION\n\nLittle Plot Collective\n\nTap a bed or visit an advisor to explore the plan.\n\nTalk to advisors\nQuest journal\nScenario lab\nCrop almanac\n8\nACTIVE BEDS\n32\nLABOUR HR/WK\n$2,200\nAVAILABLE CASH\n3\nPLAN OPTIONS\nMove farm\n\nSwipe to scroll the page. Choose Move farm to drag the map, or use the arrow controls. Mouse users can drag directly.\n\nGREENHOUSE\nMARKET\nNURSERY\nTOOL SHED\nCOUNCIL\nPACKING SHED\nEVIDENCE DESK\nWEATHER\nVisit greenhouse\nView nursery schedule\nVisit market stall\nVisit tool shed\nEnter council pavilion\nOpen packing schedule\nOpen evidence desk\nCheck weather station\nA1\nCaixin\nA2\nXiao bai cai / pak choi\nA3\nKailan\nA4\nLettuce\nB1\nCaixin\nB2\nXiao bai cai / pak choi\nB3\nKailan\nB4\nLettuce\nC1\nKailan\nC2\nOpen bed\nC3\nOpen bed\nC4\nKailan\nD1\nCaixin\nD2\nLettuce\nD3\nOpen bed\nD4\nXiao bai cai / pak choi\nMei\nCrop scientist\nRavi\nDemand analyst\nHana\nWeather scout\nBen\nResource analyst\nAsha\nPlanning chair\nIdris\nIndependent critic\n\nTap to inspect · arrows to explore\n\nPLAN PREVIEW\n8 Sept\nToday\n\nPreview only — this does not advance time or create observations.\n\nAccessible farm list\nAll 16 beds and next actions\nAdvisor shortcuts\nTalk, invite or convene council\nPlanning tools\nStrategies, timeline and resources\nFarm\nTools\nCrops\nData\nOutcomes\nSetup",
